    "description": {
      "en": "Stopped yesterday and Noah was great! Very knowledgeable and patient while I looked for a flavor I liked. It was nice to have someone who was willing to let me take my time to make sure I took home something I’d actually like/use instead of buying one and disliking it and wasting my money. Thanks Noah!\n\nStopped again yesterday and worked with a different staff member, he was awesome! Very patient with me and didn’t try to upsell me when the flavor I wanted was in a higher level of nicotine than I’m used to. He even cautioned me on increasing the nicotine level and found another flavor in the level I’m used to. These guys are top notch. A manitowoc business that values customers!"
